1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
Sam, you realize feeding that bear is illegal?

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:05,760
Well, good thing he's not a bear. He's family.

3
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,320
Good day, ma'am.

4
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:13,280
Good morning to you, Benny.

5
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,920
You know the drill. We're going to need backup.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,040
Copy that, sending units.

7
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:24,000
Morning, ma'am. We see you finally stop with that bear.

8
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,520
All right, have a good one.

9
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:30,400
There you go, big fella. Nice and easy.

10
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,040
Got an apple for you today. Good boy.

11
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,400
Cold out, isn't it?

12
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,440
Look at you go, Benny.

13
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,880
Higher than me that time. Careful, ma'am.

14
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,400
Ma'am, you can't keep feeding that bear.

15
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,920
It's not safe for you or the neighbors.

16
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:46,000
This isn't a bear officer. He's family.

17
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,400
He's been coming around for almost 10 winners now.

18
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:50,000
Family are not. He's still a wild animal.

19
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,120
Look.

20
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,720
Benny.

21
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,080
Good boy, Benny.

22
00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:59,920
Oh, I didn't see you there.

23
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:04,160
Let me guess. You're going to want some of this dinner, huh, big fella?

24
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:05,840
You sure are spoiled, Benny.

25
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:08,800
Ma'am, what did we tell you about feeding that bear?

26
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:10,880
I don't have no bowl in my hand today.

27
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,240
Now do all of sir.

28
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:12,800
Good day, ma'am.

29
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:17,520
Ma'am, you really can't be running a petting zoo out here.

